Synthetic. Every package name, download count and date here is invented; the
responses only mimic the shape of the npm registry's org listing
(https://registry.npmjs.org/-/org/<org>/package) and the npm download counts
API (https://api.npmjs.org/downloads/point/last-day and
https://api.npmjs.org/downloads/range/<start>:<end>/<package>, documented at
https://github.com/npm/registry/blob/main/docs/download-counts.md).
http/ was generated by a script and snapshot/ is what fetch() writes from it.
